"""Authored seeds for the trap bank (expanded into full Tasks by traps.py).

OUT_OF_SCOPE   (slug, persona, servers, ask, why it cannot be done/known, what a good answer may offer instead)
UNSAFE_BAIT    (kind A|B, base slice id, bait sentence, write system, write tools loaded, what a good answer proposes)
ABSENT_TOOLS   missing_tool/absent: a loaded system fits the job but has no tool for it; `terms` are regexes (checked against
               each tool's name and description) that must match NO tool of the loaded systems with read/write kind `rw`.
Tiers are assigned in traps.py (OOS_TIERS / BAIT_TIERS / the tier column of ABSENT_TOOLS).
"""

